---
// Redirección a la Central Editorial Unificada
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=https://central.neuronamedios.com" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>Redirigiendo a Sala de Redacción Central...</title>
    <script>
      window.location.replace("https://central.neuronamedios.com");
    </script>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        background: #071524;
        color: #ffffff;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        margin: 0;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .loader {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        border: 4px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border-top-color: #3b82f6;
        border-radius: 50%;
        animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      @keyframes spin {
        to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      a {
        color: #38bdf8;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="loader"></div>
    <h2>Redirigiendo a la Central Editorial</h2>
    <p>Si no te redirige automáticamente, <a href="https://central.neuronamedios.com">haz clic aquí para entrar</a>.</p>
  </body>
</html>
